      "content": "LYE GREEN  1. 967 SP 90 SE 5/104                 \t\tWhite House II 2.  Late C16 or early C17.  Timber frame, whitewashed brick nogging, tiled roof. 1 storey and attics,  2 flush casements, 2 gabled casement dormers.  Cut bracketed doorhood. North gable wall rebuilt in brick.  Formerly thatched. Listing NGR: SP9768303358"
